Rāvaṇa showers Rāma with thousands of arrows --- Rāma stands unmoved like a mountain --- Rāvaṇa bloodies Rāma's chest --- Rāma mocks Rāvaṇa as a thieving coward --- Rāma threatens Rāvaṇa with death by sharp arrows --- Rāma showers Rāvaṇa with arrow volleys --- Rāvaṇa reels and cannot wield weapons --- Rāvaṇa's driver bears him from battle
